sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant Browser as Browser (JS memory)
    participant BS as Backend Service
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant DB as auth.users (PostgreSQL)
    participant US as User Service

    User->>BS: GET /any-endpoint (no token)
    BS->>BS: Generate PKCE (code_verifier + code_challenge)
    BS->>User: redirect → AS /oauth2/authorize<br/>(client_id, redirect_uri, code_challenge)
    User->>AS: Login page
    User->>AS: POST /login (email + password)
    AS->>DB: loadUserByUsername(email)
    DB-->>AS: UserDetails
    AS->>AS: BCrypt.verify(password, hash)
    AS-->>BS: redirect → /callback?code=xyz
    BS->>AS: POST /oauth2/token<br/>(code + code_verifier)
    AS->>AS: OAuth2TokenCustomizer triggered
    AS->>US: GET /users/{sub}/profile<br/>(internal M2M token)
    US-->>AS: user_id, display_name
    AS->>AS: Adds user_id, display_name to JWT
    AS->>AS: Signs JWT with RSA private key
    AS-->>BS: access_token + refresh_token
    BS-->>Browser: access_token + refresh_token

    Browser->>BS: GET /any-endpoint<br/>Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
    BS->>BS: Validates JWT via public key (/oauth2/jwks)
    BS-->>Browser: Response

    Note over Browser,BS: When access_token expires
    Browser->>BS: POST /refresh<br/>(refresh_token)
    BS->>AS: POST /oauth2/token<br/>(refresh_token grant)
    AS-->>BS: new access_token + new refresh_token
    BS-->>Browser: new access_token + new refresh_token